{"id":"priznat_","lemma":"признать","pos":"verb","rank":1012,"glosses":["to recognize (to acknowledge the existence or legality of something)","to acknowledge, to see, to admit, to own","to find, to consider, to declare, to pronounce"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/05/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%B7%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%B7%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"признаю","2s":"признаешь","3s":"признает","1p":"признаем","2p":"признаете","3p":"признают"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"признай","2p":"признайте"}}},"past":{"m":"признал","p":"признали","f":"признала","n":"признало"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"признавать","examples":[{"text":"Я должен признать, что ты прав.","en":"I have to admit that you're right.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"must, have to"},null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you"},null]},{"text":"Мир не признал его.","en":"The world did not recognize him.","words":[{"g":"peace"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"him / his"}]},{"text":"Они признали новое правительство.","en":"They recognized the new government.","words":[{"g":"they"},null,{"g":"something new"},{"g":"government"}]},{"text":"Никто не хочет этого признать.","en":"Nobody wants to admit it.","words":[{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},null,null]},{"text":"Давай, признай это.","en":"Come on, admit it.","words":[{"g":"let's"},null,{"g":"this / it is"}]}]}